tmkc:GC-0032 a skos:Concept,
        tmk:LegalConcept ;
    rdfs:comment "\"Standard address code material\" is the Manual's own term for the common parts, which it distinguishes from the identifier. Treating them as the same thing would make every mark containing \"com\" a candidate."@en-AU ;
