tmkc:GC-0041 a skos:Concept,
        tmk:LegalConcept ;
    rdfs:comment "The not_labels separate evidence a party files from material an examiner gathers. That distinction is load-bearing under section 43, where the Manual asks examiners to research rather than to require evidence."@en-AU ;
