tmkc:GC-0051 a skos:Concept,
        tmk:LegalConcept ;
    rdfs:comment "This concept and GC-0007 pull in opposite directions and both are stated in the pilot area. How they sit together is one of the most useful things an expert could write down here."@en-AU ;
