tmkc:GC-0038 a skos:Concept,
        tmk:LegalConcept ;
    rdfs:comment "The not_label matters because the Act itself contemplates a connotation arising from \"a sign contained in the trade mark\" — so the whole and the part are both operative and must not merge."@en-AU ;
