tmkc:GC-0049 a skos:Concept,
        tmk:LegalConcept ;
    rdfs:comment "The tension is real and worth a decision: 29.3.2 directs attention to the current marketplace, 29.6 asks how well known a person was at the priority date. Whether that is a difference in the rules or a looseness in the drafting is a legal reading."@en-AU ;
