tmkc:GC-0001 a skos:Concept,
        tmk:LegalConcept ;
    rdfs:comment "The Manual states that for section 43 the term has a wider meaning than the dictionary sense and includes direct statements. That widening is a practice position, and whether it survives into the ontology as one concept or two is a judgement."@en-AU ;
